OL,3,GNEWSATrial of dentists in GP surgery is
OL,4,Aa 'game changer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor says a trial of dental
OL,7,Fservices in a GP surgery has been a
OL,8,F"game changer" for patients.
OL,10,FDr Neil Modha, a GP and managing
OL,11,Fpartner at the Thistlemoor Medical
OL,12,FCentre in Peterborough, has been
OL,13,Fleading an 18-month pilot of the new
OL,14,Fdental practice.
OL,16,FUnder the scheme, children and adults
OL,17,Fidentified as vulnerable are contacted
OL,18,Fby the GP practice and passed on to the
OL,19,Fon-site dental team.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
