OL,3,GNEWSATrial of dentists in GP surgery is
OL,4,Aa 'game changer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,500 NHS dental appointments
OL,7,Fhave been provided through the pilot
OL,8,Fsince it began in December.
